{"id":4015,"date":"2026-03-31T07:36:38","date_gmt":"2026-03-31T07:36:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/?p=4015"},"modified":"2026-03-31T07:40:27","modified_gmt":"2026-03-31T07:40:27","slug":"wisal-tower-dubai","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/wisal-tower-dubai\/","title":{"rendered":"Wisal Tower &#8211; Dubai"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Project Overview<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CDE Engineering Services was engaged to carry out a detailed assessment of post-tensioned (PT) slab systems at Wisal Tower, located in Dubai.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The study focused on investigating visible cracking in slab soffits and evaluating the condition and performance of the PT slab system.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Client<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dubi Civil Engineering LLC<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Location<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dubai, UAE<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Client Challenge<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cracks were observed in the soffit of post-tensioned slabs, raising concerns regarding structural behaviour and long-term performance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Given the nature of PT systems, the client required a clear understanding of the cause of cracking and its implications on the slab condition.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Scope of Work<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items4015_b683da-3d:not(.this-stops-third-party-issues){margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items4015_b683da-3d ul.kt-svg-icon-list:not(.this-prevents-issues):not(.this-stops-third-party-issues):not(.tijsloc){margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);margin