ss=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">Evaluation of PT slab condition<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Approach<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CDE carried out a focused investigation combining site inspection and targeted testing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The assessment involved identifying crack characteristics, reviewing slab behaviour, and correlating observed conditions with structural performance of the PT system.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Findings<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cracking was observed in the slab soffit at multiple locations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The cracks were associated with slab behaviour and stress conditions within the PT system. Localized deterioration was identified in certain areas, while the overall observations highlighted the need for further detailed evaluation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Solutions &amp; Recommendations<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Further detailed investigation was recommended to better understand the extent and implications of the observed cracking.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Appropriate crack repair methods were advised to address affected areas, along with periodic monitoring to track the condition of the slab system over time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Outcome<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The assessment provided a clear understanding of the observed slab conditions and established a basis for further evaluation and maintenance planning.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The recommendations support effective management of the structure through targeted repairs and ongoing monitoring.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Services Delivered<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items4